<section class='how-it-works'>
	<h2>How it works</h2>
	<p class='how-it-works-intro'>
		Turn spoken audio into another language while keeping the speaker's voice.
	</p>
	<ol class='how-it-works-steps'>
		<li>
			<strong>Upload</strong> — Choose a WAV or MP3 recording (up to 25MB).
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Select language</strong> — Pick the target language for translation.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Get results</strong> — Play or download translated audio that preserves the speaker's voice.
		</li>
	</ol>
</section>
